Package: postgresql-PGMAJOR-valkey-fdw
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, postgresql-PGMAJOR
Description: PostgreSQL foreign data wrapper for Valkey
 valkey_fdw presents Valkey keys as PostgreSQL foreign tables: strings,
 hashes, lists, sets and sorted sets, with TLS, ACL authentication and
 cluster support.
 .
 Writes are buffered and applied atomically by a single script at
 pre-commit, so a transaction that commits in PostgreSQL has been accepted
 by Valkey in full or not at all.
